# Dotfiles and dot-directories (editor/tool state, venvs, local config,
# .DS_Store, etc.) don't belong in version control. Add a `!.foo` exception
# below if something dot-prefixed genuinely needs to be tracked (e.g. a CI
# config under .github/).
.*
!.gitignore

# binary for local testing
dictated
dictate

# Build output (see build.sh) -- compiled binaries are build artifacts, not source.
/dist/